  "prefLabel": "Plc 906.08 Documentation Requirements; Audits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 906.08 Documentation Requirements; Audits. Licensees shall maintain records of continuing education in accordance with Plc 308.04, and shall be subject to the audit provisions in that section.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
